{"seq":14,"slug":"data-privacy-engineering","title":"数据隐私工程与合规技术","stage":"DONE","category":"law-legal","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/data-privacy-engineering","rating":{"composite":4.02,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":4,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 数据隐私工程与合规技术 简介\n\n数据隐私工程是把抽象的隐私法律义务翻译成可落地、可验证的技术控制的学科。法律告诉你「个人信息要最小化、要可被删除、要防止未授权访问」，但真正让这些要求在系统里生效的，是工程师在数据管道、存储、计算与治理流程中部署的一整套机制。本 hub 与 08_data-privacy-law 互为表里：那里讲规则与权利的法律视角，这里讲技术控制如何把规则变成代码、配置与流程里默认开启的能力，落实「设计即隐私」（privacy by design）。\n\n之所以重要，是因为合规不再能靠事后审计和一纸承诺兜底。GDPR、CCPA 以及国内《个人信息保护法》都把举证责任压给了数据处理者——你得能证明自己确实做到了。一次数据泄露或一次违规处理，代价既是巨额罚款，也是难以挽回的信任损失。把隐私保护内建到系统里，比出事后补救要便宜得多，也更能支撑业务在受监管环境中持续运转。\n\n本 hub 沿四章展开，循着数据生命周期由浅入深。第一章「PII 识别与数据分类」是一切的起点：你无法保护自己看不见的数据，所以先要发现敏感信息散落在哪、给它们贴上分类标签、绘制数据流图。第二章「去标识化与隐私增强技术」处理如何在保留数据可用性的前提下削弱其可识别性，覆盖假名化、匿名化、k-匿名、差分隐私等手段，以及它们各自的强度与再识别风险。第三章「隐私保护计算」走向更前沿的方向——在不暴露原始数据的前提下完成计算，涉及联邦学习、安全多方计算、同态加密与可信执行环境，让协作与分析不再以集中明文为代价。第四章「合规工程与治理」把前三章的技术能力收束为可运营的体系：数据主体权利的自动化响应、同意管理、留存与删除策略、隐私影响评估，以及把这些控制嵌入研发流程的工程实践。\n\n四章合起来回答同一个问题：当法律说「要保护隐私」，工程上究竟该建什么、怎么验证它真的在起作用。读完本 hub，你应当能把一条隐私要求拆解为识别、变换、计算与治理上的具体技术决策，并理解每个选择在可用性、安全性与合规性之间的权衡。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pii-identification-and-classification","title":"PII 识别与数据分类","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/data-privacy-engineering/pii-identification-and-classification","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pii-detection-techniques","title":"PII 识别技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/data-privacy-engineering/pii-identification-and-classification/pii-detection-techniques"},{"seq":2,"slug":"data-classification-and-inventory","title":"数据分类与盘点","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/data-privacy-engineering/pii-identification-and-classification/data-classification-and-inventory"},{"seq":3,"slug":"sensitive-data-discovery-at-scale","title":"规模化敏感数据发现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/data-privacy-engineering/pii-identification-and-classification/sensitive-data-discovery-at-scale"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"deidentification-and-pets","title":"去标识化与隐私增强技术","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/data-privacy-engineering/deidentification-and-pets","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"anonymization-and-pseudonymization","title":"匿名化与假名化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/data-privacy-engineering/deidentification-and-pets/anonymization-and-pseudonymization"},{"seq":2,"slug":"differential-privacy","title":"差分隐私","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/data-privacy-engineering/deidentification-and-pets/differential-privacy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"k-anonymity-and-beyond","title":"k-匿名与 l-多样性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/data-privacy-engineering/deidentification-and-pets/k-anonymity-and-beyond"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"privacy-preserving-computation","title":"隐私保护计算","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/data-privacy-engineering/privacy-preserving-computation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"homomorphic-encryption","title":"同态加密","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/data-privacy-engineering/privacy-preserving-computation/homomorphic-encryption"},{"seq":2,"slug":"secure-multiparty-computation","title":"安全多方计算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/data-privacy-engineering/privacy-preserving-computation/secure-multiparty-computation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"trusted-execution-environments","title":"可信执行环境","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/data-privacy-engineering/privacy-preserving-computation/trusted-execution-environments"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"compliance-engineering-and-governance","title":"合规工程与治理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/data-privacy-engineering/compliance-engineering-and-governance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"gdpr-ccpa-technical-controls","title":"GDPR 与 CCPA 的技术控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/data-privacy-engineering/compliance-engineering-and-governance/gdpr-ccpa-technical-controls"},{"seq":2,"slug":"consent-and-data-subject-rights","title":"同意管理与数据主体权利","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/data-privacy-engineering/compliance-engineering-and-governance/consent-and-data-subject-rights"},{"seq":3,"slug":"audit-logging-and-breach-response","title":"审计日志与泄露响应","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/data-privacy-engineering/compliance-engineering-and-governance/audit-logging-and-breach-response"}]}]}